sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant API as StoriesAnalysisService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as AI Service
  P->>API: POST /stories/analyze {situation, characters, length, subSkillIds?}
  API->>DB: AI usage blocked? analyses today < limits.story_analysis_per_day?
  alt blocked or daily limit reached
    API-->>P: 403 / 429
  end
  API->>API: replace real names with {NVx}, check blocked keywords
  API->>DB: usable sub-skills (with a published template version) + child levels
  API->>AI: analyze tokenized story (synchronous, 0 credit)
  AI-->>API: moment summary, seed event, 1-2 sub-skill codes
  API->>API: validate output, sign analysisToken (HMAC, 2 h)
  API->>DB: insert ai_requests (story_analysis)
  API-->>P: 200 summary + sub-skills (real names restored) + analysisToken
  P->>API: POST /stories {entry: family, situation, characters, length, analysisToken}
  API->>API: verify token (owner, story hash, characters)
  alt token expired or story / characters changed
    API-->>P: 422 analyze again
  end
  API->>DB: create story + story_sub_skills (position 1 = main) + skeleton
  API-->>P: 201 draft story
